Behavioral port / inspiration:
Shiki Magic Move, Anthony Fu
https://github.com/shikijs/shiki-magic-move/tree/v1.1.0
MIT License, copyright (c) 2022 Anthony Fu.
Studied src/core.ts (token matching) and src/renderer.ts (retained token movement,
enter/leave transitions). This plugin reimplements those ideas in Rust: bounded
lexical-token LCS plus one-to-one moved-identifier matching; position interpolation
and opacity driven by a supplied progress parameter. No TypeScript, CSS, Shiki
runtime, upstream syntax grammar or animation source code is copied.
The upstream license is retained in assets/shiki-magic-move-LICENSE.

